@startuml ARCH-04
!include ../theme.puml
title ARCH-04 — Xác thực JWT và phân quyền
actor Browser
component "LoginController" as Login
component "AuthServiceImpl" as Auth
component "JwtService" as JWTService
component "JWT HttpOnly cookie" as Cookie
component "JwtAuthenticationFilter" as Filter
component "SecurityConfig" as Config
component "Controller / service\nownership checks" as Ownership
database "users" as Users
Browser -> Login : email + password
Login -> Auth
Auth -> Users : tải ACTIVE user
Auth -> Auth : PasswordEncoder.matches
Auth -> JWTService : generateToken(user)
JWTService --> Cookie : signed token
Cookie --> Browser
Browser -> Filter : subsequent request
Filter -> JWTService : validate signature/expiry
JWTService -> Users : load identity
Filter -> Config : SecurityContext + route rules
Config -> Ownership : role-authorized request
Ownership --> Browser : resource or 403
note bottom of JWTService
  Runtime secret bắt buộc từ cấu hình;
  không mô hình hóa fallback khóa dự đoán.
end note
@enduml

